Vnum            14601
Name            裂口落階~
Description
深沼下方裂開一道斜斜沉下去的石階，階面滿是滑冷水膜與淤泥。每往下走一步，地表的霧聲就淡一分，而古廟裡那種悶住水氣的回音便更近一層。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       UP
ExitVnum        14512
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        14602
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         入口~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         退路~
End

End
